## Head of Water Systems Maintenance Group

Industrial holdings of Lugano (AIL) SA — open position in Lugano/Muzzano (TI).

AIL SA Casella postale 6901 Lugano Centre Via Industria 2 6933 Muzzano Tel. 058 470 70 www.ail.ch
• info@ail.ch Who we are: We are a dynamic company in the energy sector and in the supply of drinking water, evolving and with a strong focus on innovation and development of people. We are looking for a passionate and motivated person for the role of: Responsible Group Maintenance Water Systems What you will do concretely:
• you will be responsible for the group that ensures operational and maintenance management of aqueduct plants and networks, ensuring a production and distribution of water in accordance with quantitative and qualitative standards;
• ensure the proper functioning of the telemanagement system;
• You will take part in the food safety group as Control Manager. Who are you?
• you have at least an AFC in the technical field;
• preferentially you have a high school diploma in the technical field or availability to achieve it;
• you have the AF of Fontaniera/e or availability to achieve it;
• preferably you have experience in aqueduct;
• you have a proven experience in staff management;
• you have the attitude to problem solving and good analytical skills, as well as strong practical, organizational and decision making;
• you have knowledge of German and French;
• you have good knowledge in Office 365;
• you have the license to conduct category B;
• you are available at the picket service;
• you have Swiss citizenship or a residence permit. What we offer:
• a recognised and important role within a constantly evolving and consolidated reality;
• a collaborative working environment, with ample space to bring ideas and innovation;
• flexibility and support to reconcile professional and personal life;
• the possibility of further training and continuing training;
• attractive contractual, insurance and social security conditions. Attachment documents:
• motivational letter;
• complete dossier of curriculum vitae, diplomas and work certificates;
• copy of the identity document. At a later date, an excerpt from the execution and bankruptcy office will be required and an updated judicial checkout with a maximum validity of 3 months. End of the competition: Friday 3 July 2026. Please fill in the online application attached to the competition. We will carefully evaluate each dossier.

** Application deadline:* 2026-07-04

**Sector:** Energy / Public Services

**Sede:** Via Industria 2, 6933 Muzzano (Lugano), TI, Switzerland

[Official note (PDF)](https://www.ail.ch/downloadJobPosition?uuid=347d0719-8223-45b6-b82f-64bccdb601e0)

